{"additions":2611,"author":{"id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","is_bot":false,"login":"hu3mann","name":"Dj Dom"},"baseRefName":"main","baseRefOid":"f92fc172b14f6900b16e6cf1cdd4312d9c3bf571","changedFiles":14,"commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-06-19T21:12:07Z","authors":[{"email":"167156098+hu3mann@users.noreply.github.com","id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","login":"hu3mann","name":"DDD-Enterprises (DJ Daddy Dom & the Department of… Don’t ask, Don’t tell, Don’t stop, Don’t you dare…)"},{"email":"noreply@anthropic.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","login":"claude","name":"Claude Opus 4.8"}],"committedDate":"2026-06-19T21:12:07Z","messageBody":"… ledger hardening\n\nPR #917 merged the operator-gated ConPort migration foundation gate to main\n(c45b2c8e7, 19:58Z). PR #932 (\"Palette: Team Dashboard\", 559d7e2fa, 20:12Z) was\nbased on pre-#917 main and its merge reverted #917 wholesale — removing the gate\nand its tests and restoring enhanced_server.py/schema.sql to their pre-#917\nstate (re-enabling hidden startup ALTERs). No Palette content touched those\nConPort files; it was a stale-branch clobber.\n\nThis restores #917's gate at its canonical path\n(docker/mcp-servers-source/conport/migrations/conport_migration_gate.py), its\nwiring (Dockerfile COPY migrations, enhanced_server.py operator-gating,\nschema.sql, migrations 004/007/README), tests, proof bundle, and task packet,\nreturning main to the operator-gated design.\n\nIt also ports the unique ledger-safety hardening from the twin PR #928 into the\nrestored gate (not #928's separate gate file):\n\n- Incompatible-ledger fail-closed: verify introspects ledger columns and fails\n  closed with a structured \"migration ledger validation failed\" result (instead\n  of an uncaught column-level SQL traceback) when the ledger schema is not this\n  gate's native {version,filename,checksum_sha256,success} set, or when ledger\n  inspection raises an unexpected DB error.\n- No-mutate guard: apply refuses to mutate a pre-existing foreign ledger\n  (\"legacy migration ledger cannot be mutated by this gate\").\n- connect() wraps psycopg2 driver errors as a structured \"database connection\n  failed\" fail-closed result (aligned with #928), surfaced by a packaged-image\n  smoke test.\n\n#917's {\"status\":\"pass\"|\"fail-closed\"} envelope and exit 0/2 are preserved;\n#928's status strings/exit 1 were deliberately not adopted.\n\nAdds docs/90-adr/adr-conport-migration-foundation-gate.md documenting the gate\ndecision, the #932 clobber+restore, and the ported hardening.\n\nValidation:\n- PASS: pytest gate suite 28/28 (20 #917 + 8 new hardening tests)\n- PASS: docker compose build conport (gate + migrations packaged into image)\n- PASS: in-container packaged-gate verify fails closed structured (exit 2)\n- PASS: markdown-location-guard (ADR + proof md)\n- NOT_RUN: in-container verify against a live applied Postgres (positive path)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","messageHeadline":"fix(conport): restore migration foundation gate (clobbered by #932) +…","oid":"f7ac83ed2f977481f17d63d921ee9a61697bbfe5"},{"authoredDate":"2026-06-20T03:06:46Z","authors":[{"email":"167156098+hu3mann@users.noreply.github.com","id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","login":"hu3mann","name":"DDD-Enterprises (DJ Daddy Dom & the Department of… Don’t ask, Don’t tell, Don’t stop, Don’t you dare…)"}],"committedDate":"2026-06-20T03:06:46Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into merge-train-936","oid":"103f47ad05fa16264de0f64054fbd9fd6d4023cb"},{"authoredDate":"2026-06-20T03:08:41Z","authors":[{"email":"167156098+hu3mann@users.noreply.github.com","id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","login":"hu3mann","name":"DDD-Enterprises (DJ Daddy Dom & the Department of… Don’t ask, Don’t tell, Don’t stop, Don’t you dare…)"}],"committedDate":"2026-06-20T03:08:41Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"fix(conport): markdownlint heading false-positive in ADR","oid":"b34a665fec9c9b39b00c9cbdb079d829961a5952"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-19T21:12:49Z